      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "The banquet cake is almost ready in the pastry section, and Louis is proud of it. Barinov comes by to check. Then he spots something in the cream that shouldn't be there. Hear it first, then we'll pick it apart.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Шеф, я почти закончил этот торт.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Покажи мне его, Луи.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "louis",
      "t": "Я думаю, торт скоро можно подавать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
